# Strict cross-origin isolation on EVERY response of the docs site (house rule — never relax).
# `_headers` is honored by Cloudflare Pages and Netlify; GitHub Pages does NOT support custom
# headers, so the book must deploy to a host that does (or behind a header-setting proxy).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
